{"root":{"data":{"id":"dhhnafxbg4w0","created":1775029066529,"text":"随身携带样品"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhnau0zuwo0","created":1775029097227,"text":"（1）炭化温度-1","note":"新-？？？\n实际温度=设定温度-89℃\neg：850℃（set）=761℃\n这应该是第二次系统做炭化条件的\n也就是现存的第一批料\n原料是未处理的竹\n第一次的料可能是淹没销毁了？？","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhncxwk07s0","created":1775029262394,"text":"761℃","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnd1rh7cw0","created":1775029270794,"text":"961℃","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnd26fuzk0","created":1775029271698,"text":"1161℃","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhncz6cfyg0","created":1775029265162,"text":"1361℃","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhncz9njog0","created":1775029265362,"text":"1561℃","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnczcksag0","created":1775029265539,"text":"1500-1","note":"后面为了好看可能就把实际温度+39\neg：761℃当作了800℃\n这里的1500应该是实际温度1461℃\n是这一组实验里的非均匀点","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnho7pa0g0","created":1775029633121,"text":"1500-2","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnava93bs0","created":1775029099963,"text":"（2）炭化温度-2","note":"这组可能是淹没后第二次系统做炭化温度\n但也可能是第一次\n统一是没有标签，用黑色马克笔直接标注在袋子上的\n所以可能是在学校的时候有一搭无一搭地做的\n时间可能在（1）炭化温度-1之前\n标注格式例如：985℃-2h-5Cpm\n不晓得温度是实际温度还是设定温度\n后面为了好看可能是都+15℃\neg：985℃当作1000℃\n同样是有非均匀点，不知道为什么总是这样\n原料应该也是没处理的竹\n？？？\n但也可能是竹颗粒，很大可能\n不不拿着就是第三次系统做炭化条件的\n第二次可能是YSCZNZC那批","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhnm6xkteg0","created":1775029987324,"text":"未加热（通氩气）","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmc3xm3k0","created":1775029998592,"text":"985℃","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmc74o5s0","created":1775029998785,"text":"1185℃","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhijqlbjg680","created":1775120607617,"text":"SEM","progress":9},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijr9wpink0","created":1775120661140,"text":"TEM"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijrrdwvyo0","created":1775120699185,"text":"XRD"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcap5w00","created":1775029999001,"text":"1285℃","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhijqqge93k0","created":1775120618794,"text":"SEM","progress":9},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijrd081bc0","created":1775120667882,"text":"TEM"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcdh9ig0","created":1775029999169,"text":"1385℃","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhijqrdgc9s0","created":1775120620793,"text":"SEM","progress":9},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijrfpyrvk0","created":1775120673793,"text":"TEM"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcgrxh40","created":1775029999369,"text":"1485℃","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhijqsadzjs0","created":1775120622785,"text":"SEM","progress":9},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijrl7i2600","created":1775120685737,"text":"TEM"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcj0wmw0","created":1775029999505,"text":"1585℃","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhijqt9728o0","created":1775120624889,"text":"SEM","progress":9},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijrnlrdt40","created":1775120690953,"text":"TEM"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnavj4ag00","created":1775029100499,"text":"（5）葡萄糖包覆量","note":"点又不均匀，为什么老这样\n并且根据标号，很确定是故意少了2%？","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhny6tp8740","created":1775030927459,"text":"1%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7az1jc0","created":1775030928504,"text":"1.5%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7etcjc0","created":1775030928736,"text":"2.5%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7hzfoo0","created":1775030928928,"text":"3%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7l52z40","created":1775030929119,"text":"4%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7o7q2o0","created":1775030929304,"text":"无包覆（排除球磨影响）","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnavqi6ns0","created":1775029100946,"text":"（3）升温速率","note":"最后选定温度选到了1400℃\n应该对应的（2）炭化温度-2这一组","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhho7hih7xc0","created":1775031656003,"text":"1℃/min","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhho7igf2280","created":1775031658055,"text":"3℃/min","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhho7ijtww80","created":1775031658262,"text":"5℃/min","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhho7inkfkw0","created":1775031658487,"text":"7℃/min","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhho7iqh41s0","created":1775031658663,"text":"10℃/min","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnaw588800","created":1775029101837,"text":"（4）包覆剂种类","note":"1400℃炭化","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhoddmjf9k0","created":1775032117726,"text":"沥青","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhodeam3aw0","created":1775032119182,"text":"树脂","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhodeeyzxc0","created":1775032119446,"text":"淀粉","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhodei0ke00","created":1775032119630,"text":"葡萄糖","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhodeyb0pc0","created":1775032120615,"text":"蔗糖","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhodfgfafc0","created":1775032121710,"text":"柠檬酸","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue-compat","version":"1.4.43"}